  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "A fantastic opportunity to secure a 3 bedroom, 2 bathroom, solid brick home with garage, in a highly sought-after St Heliers location, zoned for St Heliers Primary and Glendowie College!\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for a property with potential, this is one you won't want to miss. Offering a solid single-level brick construction, a practical layout and a premium location, this home is ready for its next chapter. Bring your paintbrush, your imagination and a little TLC to transform this property into something truly special.\r\n\r\nThe home features a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area that flows out to a sunny deck and private garden, providing a great foundation for modernising and creating your ideal indoor-outdoor lifestyle.\r\n\r\nProperty features include:\r\n\r\n• Three generous bedrooms, including a master with its own ensuite\r\n• Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n• Family bathroom plus separate guest powder room\r\n• Separate laundry and plenty of storage\r\n• Sunny deck and private garden\r\n• Secure garage\r\n• Solid, single-level brick construction\r\n• Excellent potential to renovate, modernise and add value\r\n\r\nPositioned in a desirable St Heliers neighbourhood, the location is a real standout. Zoned for the highly regarded St Heliers Primary School and Glendowie College, this property offers an excellent opportunity for families wanting to secure an address in these sought-after school zones.\r\n\r\nThe beautiful beaches, cafés and restaurants of the Eastern Bays are just a short drive away, while convenient access to public transport and Auckland CBD adds to the appeal.",
